Name: Auto Case (dictionary word list)

Code: (lambda ()
        (default-transform 'dont-care)
        (setq-local gpr-ts-mode-case-formatting
                    '((identifier :formatter capitalize :dictionary (:words ("cOmPiLeR")))
                      (keyword    :formatter downcase)))
        (gpr-ts-auto-case-mode)
        (gpr-ts-mode-tests--simulate-key-press "SPC"))

